+        // decode to nothing the system has a font for, and their tables
+        // are 370 KB that every copy of the browser would carry in the
+        // initrd and in memory. Without a reference to these decoders the
+        // linker drops them (--gc-sections); such a page shows the
+        // replacement character. The same pages in UTF-8 are unaffected.
+        case encoding::gbk:
